    <briefdescription>
<para>This class provides callback slots to get ground specific data. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The default implementation returns values for a ball formed earth with an adjustable terrain elevation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Mathias Froehlich </para>
